Function*	Action(s)
---		-------------------------------------------------------
f00		Reset - clear all settings?

f01		Set Scaling = X-Linear, Y-Linear
f02		Set Scaling = X-Linear, Y-Log
f03		Set Scaling = X-Log, Y-Linear
f04		Set Scaling = X-Log, Y-Log
f05		Set Scaling = Polar Coords

f06		Set Type = Pie Chart
f07		Set Type = Pt-to-Pt Line
f08		Set Type = Vert Bar
f09		Set Type = Point
f10		Set Type = Linear regression
f11		Set Type = Math function (F01) - must set 00 and 01

f12		Set Axis = X+, Y+
f13		Set Axis = X+/-, Y+/-
f14		Set Axis = Horiz lines (?)
f15		Set Axis = Hatch filled (?)

F01		User math function
F01		Write alpha labeling on graph (conflict!)

* For ROM version, fxx (10 xx) becomes Axx (12 xx), and Fxx (11 xx) becomes Bxx (13 xx).
Note, user function is still F01 in both cases.
